  Title: Scientists uncover a hidden aging program in the gut that fuels cancer risk
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260108231411.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 90
  ai_summary: "Research links epigenetic changes in aging gut stem cells to increased cancer risk, potentially opening avenues for preventative strategies targeting the gut microbiome."

  Title: Study shows young blood can slow Alzheimer’s in mice
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260108231409.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 80
  ai_summary: "A study reveals that exposure to younger blood can mitigate Alzheimer's-like pathology in mice, suggesting a novel therapeutic approach targeting blood-brain barrier changes."

  Title: A hidden loop is powering deadly pancreatic cancer
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260108231406.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 85
  ai_summary: "Researchers have identified a critical three-part molecular loop driving pancreatic cancer growth, offering a potential new therapeutic target with a combination drug approach."

  Title: Scientists test a tiny eye implant that could restore sight
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260108231348.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 70
  ai_summary: "A new trial is underway to evaluate a stem cell implant for restoring vision in patients with advanced dry macular degeneration, representing a promising advancement in ophthalmology."

